desc:ICST Kristall Controller
// Control surface for JS_ICST_Kristall_Motion_Map.lua
// The Lua GUI script reads these sliders each frame via TrackFX_GetParam.
// Param index = slider number − 1  (slider1 → param 0, etc.)
// Audio passes through unchanged.

// ── Preset & Motion ───────────────────────────────────────────
slider1:0<0,8,1{None,Cubic,Tetragonal,Hexagonal,RandomSwarm,Orthorhombic,Rhombohedral,Monoclinic,Triclinic}>Preset Trigger
slider2:2<0.1,16,0.01>Rate (steps/sec or steps/beat)
slider3:0<0,1,1{Steps/sec (absolute),Steps/beat (BPM sync)}>Rate Mode
// ── Smoothing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
slider4:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>Smoothing
slider5:0.08<0,2,0.001>Glide Time (sec)
// ── Global Rotation (degrees) — map MIDI CCs here ────────────
slider6:0<-180,180,0.1>Pitch (tilt fwd/bck)
slider7:0<-180,180,0.1>Yaw   (spin L/R)
slider8:0<-180,180,0.1>Roll  (rotate CW/CCW)

@slider
// No processing — Lua reads params via TrackFX_GetParam

@block

@sample
outl = inl;
outr = inr;
